---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Authenticate with a registry

Usage: specforge login [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --registry <REGISTRY>
          Registry alias (defaults to the default registry)

      --token <TOKEN>
          Authentication token, kept as a secret (OS keyring, else a 0600 file). Exactly one of --token, --token-env, --token-file

      --token-env <TOKEN_ENV>
          Environment variable that holds the token; the variable's name is kept, not the token

      --token-file <TOKEN_FILE>
          File that holds the token; the file's path is kept, not the token

      --path <PATH>
          Path to the project root (for registry config)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
